  "abstract": "Re-runs the best LN configuration (k=320, p=32, H=96, \u03b3_end=0.99, a_max=0.993) and adds a complete() hook to export compact analysis artifacts (V, gamma_raw, s_alpha/s_beta, U norms and samples, JSON summary) to storage/ariadne/analyses/.",
